-<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
-
- <head>
-
-  <title>CSS Writing Modes Test: position absolute and 'vertical-rl' - 'left' and 'right' are 'auto', 'width' is not 'auto' with 'direction: ltr' in initial containing block</title>
